---
// HowItWorks — night canvas, 5 numbered steps.
// id="how" required for nav anchor.
---

<section id="how" class="section night">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="hiw__header stack" data-animate>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--moon">How Luna works</p>
      <h2 class="hiw__heading">
        From first WhatsApp message<br />to structured booking.
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Luna fits into the conversation your guests are already having —
        no new apps, no friction, nothing to install.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="hiw__steps" role="list" data-animate>

      <li class="hiw__step">
        <div class="hiw__step-num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div class="hiw__step-body">
          <h3 class="hiw__step-title">Guest writes naturally on WhatsApp</h3>
          <p class="hiw__step-text">
            No commands, no forms. They ask about a lesson, a board rental, a
            package, or availability — the same way they'd message a friend.
            Voice notes, typos, and mid-conversation topic switches included.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__step">
        <div class="hiw__step-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="hiw__step-body">
          <h3 class="hiw__step-title">Luna understands the request</h3>
          <p class="hiw__step-text">
            Luna reads the message in context — the full thread, not just the
            last line. It identifies what the guest actually needs: a specific
            date, a group size, a price, a change to an existing booking.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__step">
        <div class="hiw__step-num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
        <div class="hiw__step-body">
          <h3 class="hiw__step-title">Luna checks your real business info</h3>
          <p class="hiw__step-text">
            Availability, pricing rules, session capacity, add-ons, your
            house policies — Luna reads from your actual data, not a
            static FAQ. It never quotes a price it didn't get from your
            system.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__step">
        <div class="hiw__step-num" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
        <div class="hiw__step-body">
          <h3 class="hiw__step-title">Luna replies and fills in the gaps</h3>
          <p class="hiw__step-text">
            If something is missing — a date, a headcount, a contact detail —
            Luna asks for it clearly. One question at a time, in the guest's
            own language. It stays patient however long the exchange takes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw__connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw__step hiw__step--last">
        <div class="hiw__step-num hiw__step-num--accent" aria-hidden="true">05</div>
        <div class="hiw__step-body">
          <h3 class="hiw__step-title">Your team sees everything, steps in when needed</h3>
          <p class="hiw__step-text">
            Staff get full conversation context the moment they open the inbox.
            When something genuinely needs a human — a complex situation, a
            discretionary call — Luna flags it clearly and hands off cleanly.
            No hunting through chat history.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

    </ol>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw__header { max-width: 680px; }
  .hiw__heading { font-size: var(--step-4); margin-top: var(--space-xs); }

  .hiw__steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  /* Each step: number + body side by side */
  .hiw__step {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr;
    gap: 0 var(--space-l);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .hiw__step--last { padding-bottom: 0; }

  /* Vertical connector line — runs from the bottom of the number to the next */
  .hiw__connector {
    position: absolute;
    left: 1.65rem; /* center of the 3.5rem column */
    top: 3rem;     /* below the number circle */
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--night-border);
  }

  .hiw__step-num {
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--night-border);
    background: var(--night-surface);
    color: var(--moon-300);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    transition: background var(--dur) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .hiw__step:hover .hiw__step-num {
    background: var(--ink-600);
    border-color: var(--moon-300);
  }

  /* Final step number — seaglass highlight */
  .hiw__step-num--accent {
    background: #2d6155;
    border-color: var(--seaglass-600);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .hiw__step--last:hover .hiw__step-num--accent {
    background: #356f5f;
    border-color: var(--seaglass-500);
  }

  .hiw__step-body {
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .hiw__step-title {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--night-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .hiw__step-text {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--night-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .hiw__step { grid-template-columns: 2.75rem 1fr; gap: 0 var(--space-m); }
    .hiw__step-num { width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; font-size: 0.72rem; }
    .hiw__connector { left: 1.3rem; }
  }
</style>
